flowchart LR
    Dev["Developer"] -->|push feature branch| PR["Pull Request"]

    subgraph CI["CI (on PR, path-filtered)"]
        direction TB
        BackendCI["backend-ci.yml<br/>ruff + pytest/moto"]
        InfraCI["infrastructure-ci.yml<br/>ruff + pytest + cdk synth"]
        FrontendCI["frontend-ci.yml<br/>eslint + tsc + vite build"]
    end

    PR --> BackendCI
    PR --> InfraCI
    PR --> FrontendCI

    BackendCI --> Merge{"All checks pass?"}
    InfraCI --> Merge
    FrontendCI --> Merge

    Merge -->|yes| Main["main branch"]
    Merge -->|no| Dev

    Main --> Deploy["deploy.yml"]

    subgraph DeployJob["deploy.yml (OIDC, no static AWS keys)"]
        direction TB
        AssumeRole["Assume AWS role via GitHub OIDC"]
        CdkDeploy["cdk deploy --all"]
        ExtractOutputs["Extract API/Cognito outputs"]
        BuildFE["Build frontend with real config"]
        SyncS3["aws s3 sync -> SiteBucket"]
        Invalidate["CloudFront invalidation"]
    end

    Deploy --> AssumeRole --> CdkDeploy --> ExtractOutputs --> BuildFE --> SyncS3 --> Invalidate
